ure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a7/Red_fish_under_map_again.png/revision/latest?cb=20241230091623\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Red fish under map again\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a7/Red_fish_under_map_again.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241230091623\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"117\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Red fish under map again.png\" data-image-key=\"Red_fish_under_map_again.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Red_fish_under_map_again.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>If you are confused for some reason there's a red fish under the map that i found after i spawned there \n</p><p>How to get to the fish you need plot 3 with a basement and leave the game and rejoin with a different plot or find someone's plot located at plot 3 with a basement and hope you don't get kicked by them and just wait for them to leave\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903092825\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 618/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.723      1 Template:Delete\n100.00%    2.723      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3301-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 2026090309